{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会in東京!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいシャン初の握手会ですね(*^^*)楽しみにしてます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2ndの6曲の中でどれが好きかとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーや個人PVの感想とかいろいろ聞きたい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ままの日のプランとかね♪よろしくねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今夜はるんるん(斎藤ちはるchan)とお泊まりやあ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るんるん!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくねっ∪^ω^∪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか言ってる今もお話盛り上がってんよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ書き終わるくらいには寝なきゃだよねー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んまっ。書き終わってから考えるんるん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んあ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第一回乃木ここin乃木どこスタジオ、みていただけましたか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はみゅみゅ(若月佑美chan)とふたりでMCもつとめさせていたのよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうねー難しい。番組見ながら改めて反省しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかいろいろ経験不足だね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んでも乃木ここきっかけで成長できるって素敵じゃあないですかー(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆーことで、次回もお楽しみに!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/5295946/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"狼、ひめたんソロverリクエストしてもいい???"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かもーん＼(^O^)／!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/5295946/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺、東京個握の日誕生日なのよ!ひめたんいっしょにお祝いして〜(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おおおーっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃここではあえておめでとうを言わずに、明日のお楽しみじゃね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/5295946/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女性の方と握手したことありますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありますよん(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガールズトークには男子禁制ですぞ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/5295946/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/5295946/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/5295946/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロンパースINGNI?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうINGNI!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"INGNI好きですよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/5295946/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんジージャン似合うイメージあったけどよく着てるの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じーじゃん楽だから結構着てるよ♪♪(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/5295946/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"132の記事で『新!ひめたん的乃木坂ふぁみりー選抜!』に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペットとしてろってぃーを挙げたそうだけど何のペットでしょうか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/5295946/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん的乃木坂ファミリー、面白いですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このあと、誰かがファミリー入りを希望してきたら、ひめたん、どうする?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本人いわく、ろってぃーはしばいぬらしいですよ(;´∩｀)みんなかもーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/5295946/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/5295946/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは若月のことブナピーって呼ばないの(●'w'●)?笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶなぴーみゅみゅー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちがいいか明日聞いてみよっか♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぬあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のブログは149だったのに間違えて148しちゃったー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/12/5295946/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}